WEBVTT

00:03.439 --> 00:04.940
Water...

00:05.858 --> 00:07.276
Earth...

00:07.860 --> 00:09.528
Fire...

00:09.904 --> 00:11.363
Air.

00:12.240 --> 00:16.159
Long ago, the four nations
lived together in harmony.

00:16.327 --> 00:20.289
Then, everything changed
when the Fire Nation attacked.

00:20.999 --> 00:23.417
Only the Avatar,
master of all four elements,

00:23.501 --> 00:24.710
could stop them.

00:24.794 --> 00:26.295
But when the world needed him most,

00:26.379 --> 00:27.629
he vanished.

00:28.339 --> 00:29.715
100 years passed,

00:29.799 --> 00:31.883
and my brother and I
discovered the new Avatar--

00:31.968 --> 00:33.593
an airbender named Aang.

00:33.928 --> 00:35.971
And although
his airbending skills are great,

00:36.055 --> 00:38.682
he has a lot to learn
before he's ready to save anyone.

00:38.766 --> 00:39.891
Oof.

00:39.976 --> 00:42.811
But I believe Aang can save the world.

01:03.666 --> 01:05.417
I can't believe I lost him.

01:05.501 --> 01:07.294
You did everything you could.

01:07.712 --> 01:09.171
And now we need to
do everything we can

01:09.255 --> 01:10.630
to get him back.

01:10.715 --> 01:11.882
Zuko can't have gotten far.

01:11.966 --> 01:13.091
We'll find him.

01:13.551 --> 01:14.801
Aang's gonna be fine.

01:14.886 --> 01:15.886
Ok.

01:20.767 --> 01:21.808
It's all right.

01:21.893 --> 01:22.934
You stay here, Momo--

01:23.019 --> 01:24.394
In case Aang comes back.

01:24.479 --> 01:25.479
Yip, yip!

01:50.463 --> 01:52.881
Om.

01:53.633 --> 01:55.300
Om.

01:55.385 --> 01:56.718
Hello?

01:56.803 --> 01:58.053
I'm sorry to disturb you.

01:58.137 --> 01:59.554
I just really need to find

01:59.639 --> 02:00.764
the moon and the ocean spirits.

02:01.265 --> 02:03.016
Go away.

02:05.770 --> 02:07.104
You're still here?

02:07.188 --> 02:08.271
Yes, I need--

02:08.356 --> 02:10.565
Om!

02:11.067 --> 02:12.776
Perhaps that thing will help you.

02:12.860 --> 02:14.027
Chase it!

02:16.739 --> 02:17.739
Finally.

02:26.082 --> 02:27.082
Come back!

02:29.877 --> 02:31.753
Hello, Aang.

02:31.838 --> 02:32.921
Roku?!

02:57.864 --> 02:58.864
Shelter!

03:10.001 --> 03:12.252
Roku, the water tribe is under attack!

03:12.336 --> 03:14.671
I need to find
the ocean and the moon spirits.

03:16.382 --> 03:19.801
The ocean and the moon
are ancient spirits--

03:20.094 --> 03:22.429
They crossed over
from the spirit world

03:22.513 --> 03:25.807
to the mortal world
very near the beginning.

03:26.058 --> 03:28.268
There is only one spirit I know of

03:28.519 --> 03:31.062
who is old enough to remember...

03:31.147 --> 03:32.355
Who?

03:32.440 --> 03:35.150
The spirit's name is Koh,

03:35.234 --> 03:37.152
but he is very dangerous--

03:37.695 --> 03:40.864
They call him the Face Stealer.

03:41.407 --> 03:42.782
When you speak with him,

03:42.867 --> 03:44.951
you must be very careful

03:45.036 --> 03:46.953
to show no emotion at all--

03:47.121 --> 03:49.956
Not the slightest expression--

03:50.041 --> 03:52.709
Or he will steal your face.

04:12.021 --> 04:13.271
I finally have you,

04:13.940 --> 04:16.608
but I can't get you home
because of this blizzard.

04:16.692 --> 04:18.151
There's always something.

04:18.736 --> 04:20.362
Not that you would understand.

04:20.780 --> 04:22.405
You're like my sister.

04:22.490 --> 04:24.574
Everything always came easy to her.

04:24.659 --> 04:26.618
She's a firebending prodigy...

04:26.702 --> 04:28.453
And everyone adores her.

04:28.788 --> 04:30.747
My father says she was born lucky.

04:30.831 --> 04:33.083
He says I was lucky to be born.

04:34.460 --> 04:35.502
I don't need luck, though--

04:35.586 --> 04:37.212
I don't want it.

04:37.547 --> 04:39.089
I've always had to struggle and fight,

04:39.173 --> 04:40.924
and that's made me strong...

04:41.008 --> 04:42.676
It's made me who I am.

05:13.124 --> 05:14.374
I don't need to remind you

05:14.458 --> 05:15.625
we have a time limit.

05:16.210 --> 05:17.877
If we don't defeat the water tribe

05:17.962 --> 05:19.838
before the full moon rises,

05:19.922 --> 05:21.715
they will be undefeatable.

05:21.799 --> 05:23.008
I assure you--

05:23.092 --> 05:24.759
I have everything under control.

05:25.052 --> 05:27.804
I intend to remove
the moon as a factor.

05:28.139 --> 05:29.389
Remove the moon?

05:29.473 --> 05:30.599
How?

05:30.683 --> 05:32.017
Admiral Choi!

05:33.603 --> 05:35.520
Prepare to meet your fate!

05:36.480 --> 05:38.189
Whoa!

05:39.358 --> 05:40.775
As I was saying.

05:41.235 --> 05:42.861
Years ago, I stumbled upon

05:42.945 --> 05:44.988
a great and powerful secret--

05:45.531 --> 05:48.617
The identity of the moon spirit's
mortal form.

05:49.035 --> 05:50.035
What?!

05:50.369 --> 05:51.453
I was a young lieutenant

05:51.537 --> 05:53.705
serving under General Xu
in the Earth Kingdom.

05:54.457 --> 05:55.999
I discovered a hidden library--

05:56.083 --> 05:57.500
Underground, in fact.

05:57.918 --> 06:00.545
I tore through scroll after scroll.

06:00.796 --> 06:03.673
One of them contained
a detailed illustration--

06:03.758 --> 06:06.718
And the words "moon" and "ocean."

06:07.053 --> 06:09.721
I knew then that these spirits
could be found...

06:09.805 --> 06:11.264
And killed...

06:12.475 --> 06:14.893
And that it was my destiny to do so.

06:15.102 --> 06:18.021
Zhao, the spirits
are not to be trifled with!

06:18.481 --> 06:22.525
Yes, yes, I know
you fear the spirits, Iroh--

06:22.610 --> 06:23.902
I have heard rumors about your journey

06:23.986 --> 06:25.904
into the spirit world.

06:25.988 --> 06:28.156
But the ocean and moon
gave up their immortality

06:28.240 --> 06:30.325
to become a part of our world.

06:30.910 --> 06:33.536
And now they will
face the consequences.

06:53.641 --> 06:55.433
You're just a curly-tailed bluenose.

07:01.649 --> 07:03.149
Show no fear.

07:03.234 --> 07:05.026
Show no emotion at all.

07:18.749 --> 07:19.749
Hello?

07:19.834 --> 07:22.502
I'm looking for a spirit named Koh.

07:35.599 --> 07:36.808
Welcome.

07:39.645 --> 07:40.729
Thank you.

07:40.813 --> 07:43.690
My old friend, the Avatar--

07:44.108 --> 07:46.735
It's been a long time.

07:46.819 --> 07:48.027
You know me?

07:48.487 --> 07:50.822
How could I forget you?

07:50.906 --> 07:52.532
One of your previous incarnations

07:52.616 --> 07:54.117
tried to slay me--

07:54.201 --> 07:56.828
Maybe 800 or 900 years ago.

07:57.371 --> 07:58.788
I didn't know that.

07:59.790 --> 08:02.917
Why did he-- Or I-- Try to kill you?

08:03.419 --> 08:05.587
It was something about

08:05.671 --> 08:07.630
stealing the face
of someone you loved.

08:15.514 --> 08:18.266
Of course, that's all behind us.

08:18.601 --> 08:20.268
Why should I hold a grudge against you

08:20.352 --> 08:21.728
for something in a past life?

08:22.271 --> 08:24.522
After all--
You're a different person now.

08:24.607 --> 08:27.901
You've come to me with a new face.

08:33.532 --> 08:35.158
Guess we'll be here awhile.

08:38.621 --> 08:39.662
Don't worry.

08:39.747 --> 08:40.955
Prince Zuko can't be getting too far

08:41.040 --> 08:42.457
in this weather.

08:42.917 --> 08:45.126
I'm not worried
they'll get away in the blizzard.

08:45.544 --> 08:47.212
I'm worried that they won't.

08:47.296 --> 08:49.088
They're not gonna
die in this blizzard.

08:49.173 --> 08:51.758
If we know anything,
it's that Zuko never gives up.

08:52.134 --> 08:54.886
They'll survive-- And we'll find them.

08:55.471 --> 08:56.846
It's been a long time

08:56.931 --> 08:59.933
since I've added
a child's face to my collection.

09:00.309 --> 09:01.309
So...

09:01.602 --> 09:03.353
How may I help you?

09:03.604 --> 09:06.022
I need to find
the moon and the ocean.

09:06.232 --> 09:09.859
Their spirit names
are "Tui" and "La--"

09:10.444 --> 09:12.821
Push and pull.

09:12.905 --> 09:14.739
And that has been the nature

09:14.824 --> 09:17.367
of their relationship for all time.

09:17.535 --> 09:19.702
Please, help me find them.

09:20.287 --> 09:22.205
An entire culture could be destroyed

09:22.331 --> 09:23.832
if I don't get their help.

09:23.999 --> 09:26.918
You think you need their help?

09:27.127 --> 09:29.712
Actually, it's quite
the other way around.

09:30.589 --> 09:33.132
Someone is going to kill them!

09:33.384 --> 09:34.717
What do you mean?

09:34.927 --> 09:36.511
How can I find them and protect them?

09:37.137 --> 09:39.973
You've already met them, actually.

09:40.724 --> 09:44.561
Tui and La-- Your moon and ocean--

09:44.895 --> 09:47.730
Have always circled each other
in an eternal dance.

09:48.023 --> 09:50.108
They balance each other:

09:50.192 --> 09:53.027
push and pull, life and death,

09:53.237 --> 09:55.572
good and evil...

09:55.781 --> 09:57.699
Yin and Yang.

10:02.121 --> 10:03.204
The koi fish!

10:05.624 --> 10:07.208
I must be going now.

10:08.002 --> 10:09.669
We'll meet again.

10:15.092 --> 10:16.509
The spirits are in trouble!

10:16.594 --> 10:18.219
I need to get back
to the physical world!

10:18.470 --> 10:21.890
A friend is here to guide you back.

10:21.974 --> 10:22.974
Hei Bai!

11:13.859 --> 11:15.318
We'll be following this map

11:15.486 --> 11:17.153
to a very special location.

11:17.488 --> 11:19.197
And when we get there...

11:19.281 --> 11:21.366
We're going fishing.

11:25.287 --> 11:26.579
This is where I came in...

11:26.664 --> 11:28.206
But how do I get back?

11:35.881 --> 11:37.131
Good riddance.

11:42.388 --> 11:44.013
Momo!

11:44.348 --> 11:45.515
Momo?

11:45.599 --> 11:46.599
No...

11:46.892 --> 11:47.892
Where's my body?

11:55.192 --> 11:56.234
Look!

11:56.318 --> 11:57.318
That's got to be Aang!

11:57.403 --> 11:58.444
Yip, yip!

12:08.455 --> 12:09.455
Welcome back.

12:09.707 --> 12:10.707
Good to be back.

12:18.090 --> 12:19.966
That won't be enough to escape.

12:20.801 --> 12:21.801
Appa!

12:25.305 --> 12:26.305
Whoa!

12:26.390 --> 12:27.390
Here for a rematch?

12:27.766 --> 12:29.100
Trust me, Zuko,

12:29.268 --> 12:30.685
it's not going to be much of a match.

12:37.234 --> 12:39.694
Hey, this is some quality rope.

12:39.778 --> 12:41.237
We need to get to the oasis!

12:41.697 --> 12:42.864
The spirits are in trouble.

12:47.703 --> 12:49.871
Wait-- We can't just leave him here.

12:50.414 --> 12:51.414
Sure, we can.

12:51.498 --> 12:52.498
Let's go.

12:52.583 --> 12:53.583
No.

12:53.667 --> 12:55.084
If we leave him, he'll die.

12:59.214 --> 13:00.548
Yeah, this makes
a lot of sense--

13:00.632 --> 13:03.301
Let's bring the guy
who's constantly trying to kill us.

13:35.459 --> 13:36.459
Are you ok?

13:36.543 --> 13:37.919
I feel faint.

13:38.087 --> 13:39.212
I feel it, too.

13:41.256 --> 13:43.049
The moon spirit is in trouble.

13:43.342 --> 13:45.426
I owe the moon spirit my life.

13:45.511 --> 13:46.511
What do you mean?

13:46.887 --> 13:48.054
When I was born,

13:48.138 --> 13:50.431
I was very sick and very weak.

13:51.100 --> 13:53.101
Most babies cry when they're born,

13:53.602 --> 13:55.686
but I was born as if I were asleep,

13:55.771 --> 13:57.105
my eyes closed.

13:57.439 --> 14:00.191
Our healers did everything they could.

14:00.567 --> 14:03.444
They told my mother and father
I was going to die.

14:04.279 --> 14:07.073
My father pleaded
with the spirits to save me.

14:07.699 --> 14:09.909
That night-- Beneath the full moon--

14:09.993 --> 14:13.538
He brought me to the oasis
and placed me in the pond.

14:13.622 --> 14:15.706
My dark hair turned white.

14:16.208 --> 14:18.459
I opened my eyes and began to cry...

14:18.544 --> 14:19.752
Waah!

14:19.837 --> 14:21.212
And they knew I would live.

14:22.131 --> 14:24.340
That's why my mother named me Yue,

14:24.424 --> 14:25.675
for the moon.

14:28.929 --> 14:32.348
I am a legend now.

14:32.766 --> 14:34.559
The Fire Nation will for generations

14:34.643 --> 14:36.727
tell stories about the Great Zhao,

14:36.812 --> 14:38.771
who darkened the moon.

14:39.439 --> 14:42.316
They will call me
Zhao the Conqueror...

14:42.401 --> 14:44.443
Zhao the Moon-slayer...

14:44.778 --> 14:47.196
Zhao the Invincible!

14:48.365 --> 14:50.908
Get it off!

14:59.751 --> 15:01.002
Don't bother.

15:02.921 --> 15:04.922
Zhao, don't!

15:05.382 --> 15:07.008
It's my destiny...

15:07.092 --> 15:09.260
To destroy the moon

15:09.344 --> 15:10.887
and the Water Tribe.

15:11.221 --> 15:12.388
Destroying the moon

15:12.472 --> 15:14.432
won't just hurt the Water Tribe,

15:15.100 --> 15:16.559
It will hurt everyone--

15:16.643 --> 15:17.935
Including you.

15:18.520 --> 15:19.687
Without the moon,

15:19.771 --> 15:21.731
everything would fall out of balance--

15:21.815 --> 15:24.108
You have no idea what kind of chaos

15:24.193 --> 15:25.568
that would unleash on the world.

15:25.819 --> 15:27.278
He's right, Zhao.

15:27.779 --> 15:29.488
General Iroh,

15:29.573 --> 15:31.240
why am I not surprised

15:31.325 --> 15:32.825
to discover your treachery?

15:33.035 --> 15:35.036
I'm no traitor, Zhao.

15:35.120 --> 15:37.330
The Fire Nation needs the moon, too.

15:37.414 --> 15:39.999
We all depend on the balance.

15:40.876 --> 15:43.002
Whatever you do to that spirit,

15:43.086 --> 15:45.630
I'll unleash on you tenfold!

15:45.923 --> 15:47.298
Let it go now!

16:29.049 --> 16:30.800
There's no hope now.

16:31.426 --> 16:32.635
It's over.

16:34.805 --> 16:35.805
No...

16:35.889 --> 16:36.973
It's not over.

17:53.258 --> 17:54.300
You're alive?!

17:54.551 --> 17:56.135
You tried to have me killed!

17:59.556 --> 18:00.723
Yes, I did.

18:01.224 --> 18:02.767
You're the Blue Spirit--

18:02.851 --> 18:04.852
An enemy of the Fire Nation!

18:05.354 --> 18:07.146
You freed the Avatar.

18:07.481 --> 18:08.606
I had no choice!

18:12.527 --> 18:15.029
You should have chosen
to accept your failure,

18:15.322 --> 18:16.906
your disgrace...

18:17.115 --> 18:19.700
Then at least you could have lived.

18:31.380 --> 18:32.671
It's too late--

18:33.423 --> 18:34.423
It's dead.

18:38.136 --> 18:40.554
You have been touched
by the moon spirit.

18:40.972 --> 18:43.057
Some of its life is in you.

18:43.392 --> 18:45.684
Yes, you're right...

18:45.894 --> 18:48.145
It gave me life.

18:48.939 --> 18:50.481
Maybe I can give it back.

18:51.650 --> 18:52.733
No!

18:52.818 --> 18:53.901
You don't have to do that.

18:54.486 --> 18:56.028
It's my duty, Sokka.

18:56.113 --> 18:57.613
I won't let you.

18:57.697 --> 18:59.824
Your father told me to protect you!

18:59.908 --> 19:01.075
I have to do this.

19:14.464 --> 19:15.464
No!

19:17.884 --> 19:20.594
She's gone.

20:20.155 --> 20:21.947
Good-bye, Sokka.

20:22.407 --> 20:24.033
I'll always be with you.

21:04.115 --> 21:05.324
It can't be!

21:16.044 --> 21:17.086
Take my hand!

21:34.229 --> 21:36.730
I've decided to go to the South Pole.

21:36.815 --> 21:39.316
Some other benders and healers
want to join me.

21:39.401 --> 21:41.944
It's time we helped rebuild
our sister tribe.

21:42.571 --> 21:43.821
What about Aang?

21:43.905 --> 21:45.906
He still needs to learn waterbending.

21:45.991 --> 21:48.325
Well-- Then he better get used to

21:48.410 --> 21:50.661
calling you Master Katara.

21:53.373 --> 21:55.499
The spirits gave me a vision

21:55.584 --> 21:56.875
when Yue was born.

21:57.210 --> 21:59.003
I saw a beautiful,

21:59.087 --> 22:03.424
brave young woman
become the moon spirit.

22:04.509 --> 22:05.926
I knew this day would come.

22:06.386 --> 22:07.720
You must be proud.

22:07.804 --> 22:09.388
So proud...

22:10.473 --> 22:11.473
And sad.

22:13.768 --> 22:16.270
I'm surprised, Prince Zuko,

22:16.479 --> 22:17.730
Surprised that you are not

22:17.814 --> 22:20.858
at this moment
trying to capture the Avatar.

22:21.693 --> 22:22.985
I'm tired.

22:23.069 --> 22:24.945
Then you should rest.

22:25.822 --> 22:27.740
A man needs his rest.

22:45.550 --> 22:46.842
You, too, Momo!

22:46.926 --> 22:47.926
Come here!

22:58.813 --> 23:01.273
Iroh is a traitor,

23:01.358 --> 23:04.151
and your brother Zuko is a failure.

23:04.694 --> 23:07.237
I have a task for you...
